  },
  data: {
    LLM: '1. Players place an **Ante** bet.\n2. Both player and dealer are dealt 7 cards.\n3. Players either **Fold** (lose Ante) or **Raise** based on their hand.\n4. **Raise Amounts**:\n   - 4-card flush or lower: Raise = 1x Ante.\n   - 5-card flush: Raise = Up to 2x Ante.\n   - 6 or 7-card flush: Raise = Up to 3x Ante.\n5. Dealer reveals their hand. The dealer must **Qualify** with at least a 3-card 9-high flush.',
    Player: '1. Players place an **Ante** bet.\n2. Both player and dealer are dealt 7 cards.\n3. Players either **Fold** (lose Ante) or **Raise** based on their hand.\n4. **Raise Amounts**:\n   - 4-card flush or lower: Raise = 1x Ante.\n   - 5-card flush: Raise = Up to 2x Ante.\n   - 6 or 7-card flush: Raise = Up to 3x Ante.\n5. Dealer reveals their hand. The dealer must **Qualify** with at least a 3-card 9-high flush.',
    objective: "Have a flush consisting of more cards than the dealer's flush. If the card counts are equal, the higher-ranking cards within the flush win.",
    gameplay: '1. Players place an **Ante** bet.\n2. Both player and dealer are dealt 7 cards.\n3. Players either **Fold** (lose Ante) or **Raise** based on their hand.\n4. **Raise Amounts**:\n   - 4-card flush or lower: Raise = 1x Ante.\n   - 5-card flush: Raise = Up to 2x Ante.\n   - 6 or 7-card flush: Raise = Up to 3x Ante.\n5. Dealer reveals their hand. The dealer must **Qualify** with at least a 3-card 9-high flush.',
    keyRules: [
      'Dealer qualifies with at least 3-card flush 9-high.',
